#: ../../source/docs/airmode.rst:5 f649268d778d435f9f7ed5d37b7bc55f
msgid "AirMode"
msgstr "AirMode"

#: ../../source/docs/airmode.rst:7 8239a34a0bcc4fbab648c6bd36f1452c
msgid ""
"This is not an actual flight mode, but rather, an important feature of ACRO "
"and STABILIZE mode. Other flight control software refer to it as a flight "
"mode, so for consistency, its included in the Copter flight modes "
"documentation"
msgstr ""
"这不是一个实际的飞行模式，而是Acro和Stabilize模式的一个重要特性。其他飞控软件将其称为飞行模式，为保持一致性，将其纳入飞行模式文档中。"

#: ../../source/docs/airmode.rst:10 cbf203909a2e4e339f85155aec0f909f
msgid "What it is"
msgstr "它是什么"

#: ../../source/docs/airmode.rst:12 20c9b4927be144bab5fd80a980708681
msgid ""
"Normally, in Copter, if arming is setup via the rudder stick, if throttle is"
" lowered to idle in ACRO mode, the stabilization is removed. While this "
"prevents movement due to vibration while on the ground at idle throttle, it "
"prevents stabilization in flight for aerobatic movements or rapid descents."
msgstr ""
"通常情况下，在飞行器中，如果通过方向舵摇杆设置解锁，若在Acro模式下将油门降至怠速，姿态稳定将被取消。虽然这可以防止在地面怠速时因震动而运动，但它阻止了飞行中特技动作或快速下降时的稳定控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/airmode.rst:14 e2e4d29b66b141fa9bb82fe9c6c786c4
msgid ""
"If a transmitter switch is used with  ``RCx_OPTION`` ARM/DISARM with Airmode"
" (option 154) and used to arm, then stabilization at idle throttle is still "
"fully active, which is often referred to as AIRMODE."
msgstr ""
"如果使用遥控器开关配合 ``RCx_OPTION`` ARM/DISARM with "
"Airmode（选项154）进行解锁，则在怠速油门时稳定仍然完全有效，这通常称为AIRMODE。"

#: ../../source/docs/airmode.rst:16 49b9c9c325934a19bfac48c2646306fb
msgid ""
"to avoid enabling AIRMODE but still use an ARM/DISARM switch, use "
":ref:`Auxiliary function <common-auxiliary-functions>` option \"153\" for "
"the switch."
msgstr ""
"若要避免启用AIRMODE但仍使用ARM/DISARM开关，请为该开关使用 :ref:`辅助功能 <common-auxiliary-"
"functions>` 选项\"153\"。"

#: ../../source/docs/airmode.rst:18 54faf1ffa39e4c9480fd9e20a04d08da
msgid ""
"AIRMODE can also be set to be active without using the ``RCx_OPTION`` switch"
" to arm. Setting an RC channel to ``RCx_OPTION`` = 84, allows enabling or "
"disabling AIRMODE in ACRO and STABILIZE modes directly. In addition, setting"
" bit 0 of :ref:`ACRO_OPTIONS<ACRO_OPTIONS>` will activate AIRMODE in ACRO "
"mode (only) all the time, except if overridden by the above switch, if used."
msgstr ""
"AIRMODE也可以不通过 ``RCx_OPTION`` 开关来解锁而设置为激活状态。将某个RC通道设置为 ``RCx_OPTION`` = "
"84，可以直接在Acro和Stabilize模式中启用或禁用AIRMODE。此外，设置 "
":ref:`ACRO_OPTIONS<ACRO_OPTIONS>` "
"的第0位将使AIRMODE在Acro模式（仅限）中始终激活，除非被上述开关覆盖（如果使用的话）。"

#: ../../source/docs/airmode.rst:20 2e1a4d333d9048ca9abbad93e780e4ea
msgid "AIRMODE has no effect in Traditional Helicopter"
msgstr "AIRMODE对传统直升机无效"

#: ../../source/docs/airmode.rst:22 f79f4f7816d9447ea93f0596c0fadea4
msgid ""
"It isn't sufficient to just enable arming on an ``RCx_OPTION`` switch, you "
"*also* have to actually use it for arming. So if you have it on a switch but"
" then use rudder-arming then you won't get \"airmode\"."
msgstr ""
"仅在 ``RCx_OPTION`` "
"开关上启用解锁功能是不够的，您*还*必须实际使用它来解锁。因此，如果您将其设置在开关上，但随后使用方向舵解锁，则不会启用\"airmode\"。"
